that a PR event right after this news will result in a demonstration, and that will completely undermine our intentions. We've got to backtrack quickly.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: What are you suggesting? Should I move into a new direction? A new direction requires workers with a different skill-set. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Why don't you retrain staff to fit those needs? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: That can't be as time or cost-effective as hiring new specialists.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn7le14ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: What could be less cost-effective than bad press? The word is out but it may not be too late.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Give me your plan.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You ought to make a statement at the event. Once it's public that you will be retraining current employees the concerns will disappear. I'm sure you'll be recast as a thoughtful employer who is able to keep up with the times.", "id": 3, "time": "57000", "image": "engenn7le14ob02re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le14ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le14ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}